"""Shape test suite for the Cerise build.

All shape checks run via:
  bazel test //build/checks:all

Every check ships with fixtures: a known-good input the check must accept AND
a known-bad input it must reject.

Earlier governance checks (legacy_freeze, frozen_inputs, vendored_divergence)
and the live-closure/partition manifest checks (closure_inventory,
closure_parity, partition, build_manifest_conformance) were removed: Cerise
borrows Fuchsia constructs directly rather than tracking against a frozen
upstream import.

Retained checks:
  layer_string, no_policy_in_build, layering_negative_probe,
  flag_manifest_golden (kernel/phys/efi/user + rust user),
  no_genrule_in_image, hermeticity, sdk_visibility, toolchain_ambient_include,
  arch_separation_proof.
"""

load("@rules_shell//shell:sh_test.bzl", "sh_test")
load("//bazel:fuchsia_platform.bzl", "fuchsia_artifact")

